// Release configuration of every target that ships in the archive (IzzyMap
// now; the IzzyMapAssets extension once it exists) — see project.yml
// `configFiles` and docs/CI.md.
//
// Locally the include below finds nothing: Release keeps the project-wide
// CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic (Xcode-managed signing), exactly like Debug.
//
// In CI, `fastlane build` writes CI.generated.xcconfig (gitignored) with
// manual signing — the match "App Store" profile and the shared distribution
// certificate — and the build number (latest TestFlight build + 1). It sits
// at target level, so it overrides the project-level settings in project.yml
// but never touches the Swift package targets (IzzyKit, MapLibre), which a
// command-line PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER would break.
#include? "CI.generated.xcconfig"
